            "review_title": "Review at Sultan Istanbul Kebab, Da Nang Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Kylie Stewart\nGreater Sydney, Australia88 contributions\n0\nDelicious, Fresh Turkish Food!\nNov 2025 • Couples\nWe were just going for a walk and decided to stop in here. So glad we tried this restaurant! They offer so much more than a great kebab. We had one of the most delicious and fresh lunches since visiting Vietnam. I absolutely will be going back every time we are in the area. Not to be missed. 100% recommend their amazing food and beautiful atmosphere. Wish I took more photos but I was too busy enjoying the food and experience.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nNot to be missed! Every dish is sensational.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 13, 2025",
